#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconnect, only needed in a new kernel session: re-run the [Authentication](#1-authentication) cell to recreate `serverless`, then rebuild the `job` handle from the ID you saved. Skip this cell if you are still in the session where you submitted, because the handle is already live.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check status: re-run until it reports `DONE`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch the result: run only once the status is `DONE`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Paste your saved ID over the placeholder in the following reconnect cell.\n"
msgstr ""

